      "offsetInSection": 764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5480020B410C5B4C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬 트레이너인 네가 먼저\n풀이 죽은 모양이군.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŏ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAAC0020D2B8B808C774B108C7780020B124AC000020BA3CC800000AD480C7740020C8FDC7400020BAA8C591C774AD70002E001000020114014F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "풀죽지 않고 승부를 걸어오다니\n제법 괜찮은 포켓몬 트레이너군!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŏ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 840,
