      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "풀이 죽어도...\n죽지 않아도...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n포켓몬과 트레이너는\n승리라는 골을 노려야 하는 법!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŏ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D480C7740020C8FDC5B4B3C4002E002E002E000AC8FDC9C00020C54AC544B3C4002E002E002E00100001BE01000AD3ECCF13BAACACFC0020D2B8B808C774B108B294000AC2B9B9ACB77CB2940020ACE8C7440020B178B824C57C0020D558B2940020BC950021001000020114014F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "너는 그야말로\n왕의 멘탈을 가진 트레이너!<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n그런 네게 딱 어울리는 도구를 주마!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŏ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B108B2940020ADF8C57CB9D0B85C000AC655C7580020BA58D0C8C7440020AC00C9C40020D2B8B808C774B108002100100001BE00000AADF8B7F00020B124AC8C0020B5310020C5B4C6B8B9ACB2940020B3C4AD6CB97C0020C8FCB9C80021001000020114014F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "왕의징표석을 지닌 포켓몬은\n공격했을 때 상대를 풀죽게 만들기 쉬워지지.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŏ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C655C758C9D5D45CC11DC7440020C9C0B2CC0020D3ECCF13BAACC740000AACF5ACA9D588C7440020B54C0020C0C1B300B97C0020D480C8FDAC8C0020B9CCB4E4AE300020C26CC6CCC9C0C9C0002E001000020114014F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "상대의 불리함은 곧 자신의 유리함!\n앞으로 더 강해지길 바란다!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŏ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
